  "description": "The practice of accepting and valuing oneself, including one’s flaws and identity. The text in the meme explicitly references the inability to accept oneself, which is a core concept in psychology and self-help literature. The drag performer’s confident external presentation contrasts with the internal struggle of self-love, making this concept central to understanding the meme’s message.",
